+/*
+ * Wakeup pin effective minimum time in number of 32 RTCLK cycles, used as
+ * glitch filter logic. Maximum of 2 seconds if the RTCLK is 32768Hz
+ * If this value is configured to 0, and the WKUP pin keeps low longer than 15 RTCLK periods,
+ * it will wakes up RTC from Hibernation. The glitch filter time equals to HWFCR*32 RTCLK period.
+ *
+ * Default can be left unset.
